# Task Checklist
- [ ] Open the Car Dashboard app
- [ ] Select Speedometer (Analog)
- [ ] Open Mini Settings
- [ ] Cycle through Visual Models: FUTURISTIC, CLASSIC, NEON
- [ ] Select a Digital Gauge (e.g. Range)
- [ ] Cycle through Visual Models: MODERN, MINIMAL, MATRIX
- [ ] Select a Bar Gauge (e.g. Motor Temp)
- [ ] Cycle through Visual Models: GRADIENT, BLOCKS
- [ ] Close settings
- [ ] Final check of the premiums and distinct look
